<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's forex reserves $1.747 bln end-June 97.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's forex reserves $1.747 bln end-June 97.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's gross official forex reserves at end-June 1997 stood at $1.747 billion, down 9.9 percent from end-December last year when they were at $1.938 billion, the Central Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Comparitive figures for June 1996 were not available.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
